+}
+
+/* P7.29 UI-integrity: one viewport-bounded dialog regardless of content count.
+   Toolbar/footer keep their natural size; scrolling belongs to the lists and board. */
+.xen-meta-toolbar{flex:0 0 auto}
+.xen-meta-footer{flex:0 0 auto}
